    "sections": [
      {
        "kind": "definition",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Lead ads are a Pinterest ad format that delivers an in-ad form, so people can submit their information without leaving Pinterest.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Lead ads are not available to everyone on Pinterest; interested advertisers must contact their account manager to gain access.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "The advertiser controls the text shown in the lead form's description, questions and confirmation sections.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "The lead form is made of components: a call to action button, a privacy policy link, optional additional disclosure language, questions people answer with their information, and a completion message.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Questions are mandatory prompts such as 'Email'; you can select from a range of options or write your own.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "After submission, responses can be downloaded for up to 30 days via Pinterest Ads Manager or the Pinterest API, or through integrations with Zapier, Salesforce or Salesforce Sales Cloud.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Lead ad data is deleted 30 days after a lead is submitted and cannot be retrieved, so timely export is essential.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Because submissions are captured in-platform rather than on a destination site, in-form completion depends on the form's own questions and messaging, which means shorter, purposeful forms are a practical way to protect lead volume — a trade-off against collecting richer answers.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "A useful KPI to watch is cost per lead: the mechanism delivers raw lead responses, not verified downstream sales, so treat leads as an attributed signal, not proof of incremental revenue.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "use_cases",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Use it when you want to reach people who are actively looking for, and interested in, your goods and services and collect their contact information.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Use it when you can act on leads quickly, since the data is only retrievable for 30 days after submission.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Do not rely on it when your team cannot commit to regular exports or a CRM integration, because lead data is permanently deleted 30 days after submission.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "pinterest.formats.lead_ads",
                "source_url": "https://help.pinterest.com/en-gb/business/article/lead-ads",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Pinterest Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Lead ads",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
